{
  "title": "ase-calculator-kit: a unified ASE calculator factory for MLIP and DFT calculators",
  "description": "<p>A thin, unified <a href=\"https://wiki.fysik.dtu.dk/ase/\">ASE</a> calculator factory for machine-learning interatomic potentials (SevenNet, CHGNet, MatterSim, NequIP OAM, UMA/fairchem) and external DFT calculators (VASP, Quantum ESPRESSO). Every call returns a standard <code>ase.Calculator</code>, so the rest of an ASE workflow stays unchanged.</p>",
